    "text": "LA/6/2/92 Urban Development Authority Ref. No.: 10/3/590. It is hereby given notice, that the Gazette Notification published in Mr. Mahinda Rajapaksha, Former Minister of Defence & Urban Development regarding the Urban Development Authority Law No. 41 of 1978 of the National State Assembly Order under Section 15(1) published in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 1802/10 dated 19.03.2013 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka should be amended as follows. PATALI CHAMPIKA RANAWAKA (M. P.), Minister of Megapolis & Western Development",
