      669.24,
      286.42,
      713.36
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 15(1) of the Urban Development Authority Law No. 41 of 1978, I Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
