    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      442.4,
      542.52,
      712.37
    ],
    "text": "Megapolis & Western Development do by this Order vest with the Urban Development Authority, with effect from today the land described in the schedule hereto belongs to the Jaffna Municipal Council. Description of the land to be vested: The land called Rest House premises, Kandy Road containing in extent of 31.46P depicted as lot No. 1 in Plan No. 4013/10 dated 24.08.2010 made by K. Kanagasabai, Registerd Licensed Surveyor and Leveller situated at Village of Koddai in Divisional Secretariat Division of Jaffna within the Municipal Council limits of Jaffna in District of Jaffna Nothern Province. The land is bounded as follows: North: Kandy main Road; East: Trace of an old foundation; South: Reservation for Road; West: Beach Road.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
